  "details": "This issue predates the transition to this beta version, but the overall performance has been acting strangely.\n\nFor example, tabs wouldn’t appear when switching them using the buttons below the main menu, and after opening a world’s details from the World Menu and returning to the World Menu via the tab buttons, no worlds would be displayed. Most recently, the Social tab has started to get stuck in a loop. This is simply too critical. This prevents us from performing the fundamental act of interacting with other VRChat users.\n\nIf this isn’t fixed immediately, it will become an all-too-common occurrence for players. Please address this as soon as possible.",
